</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.31</h2><ul><li><strong>用得不多的每周限额仍会写出用尽预估。</strong> 在「设置 → 用量」打开「显示预估」后，只报告重置时间、不报告窗口长度的每周限额（包括 Kimi Code）在已用不到四分之一时仍显示「预计可维持到本轮重置」，窗口已经打开一段时间也一样；已用达到四分之一、仍然没有长度时，这一行不显示。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/93">#93</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.31">在 GitHub 查看更新说明</a></p>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.31</h2><ul><li><strong>A lightly used week still shows the exhaustion estimate.</strong> With Show the estimate on under Settings → Usage, a weekly limit that reports a reset and no length, including Kimi Code, still says the window is expected to last while less than a quarter is spent, even when that window is already open. At a quarter spent, with no length reported, that line stays off. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/93">#93</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.31">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
